### ✅ Good: Comprehensive Test Suite
```
DST (Decision Support Tool) Tests:
✅ Positive: 85 tests (51%) - All workflows covered
✅ Negative: 20 tests (12%) - Error handling validated
✅ Edge Cases: 20 tests (12%) - Boundaries tested
✅ Security: 20 tests (12%) - OWASP coverage
✅ Concurrency: 20 tests (12%) - Race conditions tested
Total: 165 tests - COMPREHENSIVE ✅
```

