```
Feature XYZ Tests:
✅ Positive: 50 tests (100%)
❌ Negative: 0 tests (0%) - MISSING
❌ Edge Cases: 0 tests (0%) - MISSING
❌ Security: 0 tests (0%) - MISSING
❌ Concurrency: 0 tests (0%) - MISSING
Total: 50 tests - INCOMPLETE ❌
```

